---
description: RevivePay AI standing engineering contract
alwaysApply: true
---

This repository is built in numbered phases. Before writing any code you MUST read, in this order:
1. AGENTS.md — the binding operating contract and the financial-safety invariants. Obey it exactly.
2. ARCHITECTURE.md — the architecture of record.
3. STATUS.md — the current phase, what is done, what is broken, and the next action.

Hard rules:
- Do not invent the phase plan. Only do the phase you are explicitly asked to do.
- Never delete, skip, xfail or weaken an existing test to make your change pass.
- No TODO comments, no stubs, no NotImplementedError, no placeholder return values.
- Never hard-code an evaluation metric. Metrics are computed from real run output only.
- An LLM output must never reach a payment execution path without passing schema validation, invariant checks and the deterministic policy kernel.
- Money is always an integer number of paise. No float or Decimal currency anywhere.
- No module under core/features, core/risk_model, core/econ, core/llm or core/policy may import core/environment.
- Secrets come from environment variables only. Never commit or log a key.
- When you finish a task, update STATUS.md and run scripts/verify.ps1 until it is green.
